  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (number of outcomes above the average outcome) is not considered by the individual. Instead, the individual explicitly focuses on expected value. The decision reason's rule — preferring the lottery with more outcomes above the average — is not reflected in the reported deliberation. The individual's justification is based on expected value, not on counting outcomes above the average. Therefore, the decision reason was not used. The individual did not evaluate the average outcome or count outcomes above it. There is no evidence of application of the specified reason in the verbal report.",
